cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite the DA-SFCN monograph and this repository.
title: "DA-SFCN: Dynamically-Adaptive Saddle-Free Cubic Newton Family"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "DA-SFCN contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jameljoni1994-ENG/DA-SFCN"
url: "https://github.com/jameljoni1994-ENG/DA-SFCN"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-15"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Dynamically-Adaptive Saddle-Free Cubic Newton
  (DA-SFCN) and extensions (VR, lazy Krylov, L-BFGS warm start, federated,
  spectral certificate), with bilingual research papers and reproducible
  CPU-friendly experiments.
keywords:
  - nonconvex optimization
  - cubic Newton
  - Krylov subspace
  - saddle-free Newton
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "The DA-SFCN Family: Dynamically Adaptive Saddle-Free Cubic Newton"
  authors:
    - name: "Numerical Optimization Group"
  year: 2026
  notes: "See papers/unified/ in the repository"
